[CENTER][IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/UltraReports/assets/banner.png[/IMG]

[SIZE=5][B]Player reports with a staff GUI workflow.[/B][/SIZE]

UltraReports gives players an easy way to report rule breakers and gives staff an inbox where every report is claimed, handled and closed.
UltraReports is part of the [B][COLOR=#8B5CF6]Ultra[/COLOR][COLOR=#22D3EE]Plugins[/COLOR][/B] series: every plugin shares the same colours, the same message layout and the same command structure.

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-features.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*]Report GUI with configurable reasons
[*]Staff inbox with status: open, in progress, closed
[*]Claim a report and teleport straight to the player
[*]Cooldown and abuse protection
[*]Discord webhook for new reports
[*]Punish straight from the report with UltraPunish
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-layout.png[/IMG]

No chat spam. Every confirmation, countdown and status appears in the [B]action bar[/B].
Only [B][COLOR=#F87171]errors[/COLOR][/B] are sent to the chat, so players never miss them.
All messages use MiniMessage and can be changed in the language files.

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/UltraReports/assets/preview.png[/IMG]

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-languages.png[/IMG]

[B]English · Deutsch · Français · Nederlands · Italiano[/B]
Every player sees UltraReports in the language of their Minecraft client – automatically.
Players with any other language get your default language, which you set in the config or with [FONT=Courier New]/ultrareports language <code>[/FONT].
All texts live in [FONT=Courier New]lang/<code>.yml[/FONT] and can be edited freely.

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-commands.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/report <spieler> [grund][/COLOR][/FONT] – Report a player [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrareports.report)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/reports [id][/COLOR][/FONT] – Open the staff inbox or one report [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrareports.staff)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/ultrareports <help|reload|version|language>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Administration [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrareports.admin)[/COLOR]
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-permissions.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultrareports.notify[/FONT] – Receive notifications about new reports
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultrareports.bypass.cooldown[/FONT] – Skip the cooldown
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultrareports.*[/FONT] – Everything
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-installation.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST=1]
[*]Download UltraReports and drop the jar into your [FONT=Courier New]plugins[/FONT] folder (Paper 1.20.4+, Java 17+).
[*]Restart your server.
[*]Adjust [FONT=Courier New]config.yml[/FONT] and the files in [FONT=Courier New]lang/[/FONT], then run [FONT=Courier New]/ultrareports reload[/FONT].
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-series.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][B]UltraSpawn[/B] – Spawn management done right.
[*][B]UltraTeleports[/B] – Requests, random teleport & back in one plugin.
[*][B]UltraPunish[/B] – Clean moderation with GUI, templates & history.
[*][B]UltraHomes[/B] – Set, manage and share homes in one GUI.
[*][B]UltraWarps[/B] – Server & player warps with categories.
[*][B]UltraChat[/B] – Formatting, channels & moderation for your chat.
[*][B]UltraEconomy[/B] – Fast, Vault-ready economy with multiple currencies.
[*][B]UltraKits[/B] – Kits with previews, cooldowns & in-game editor.
[*][B]UltraVanish[/B] – True invisibility for your staff team.
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-support.png[/IMG]

Found a bug or have an idea? Please use the discussion tab or send a private message instead of leaving a bad review. We answer every request.[/CENTER]
